    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d897">

                <pb facs="0906" n="648" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg648"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/2311</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Germany</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Gerard</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-12-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 20, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2518. Your 3238, December 18, 2 p. m. German Ambassador here has been granted the
                    privilege of communicating with his Foreign Office through the Department in
                    cipher concerning <hi rendition="#italic">Lusitania</hi>. Question of further
                    privileges will be handled with German and Austrian Embassies here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
